{
  "page": 583,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5703,
      "text": "Sungguh, orang-orang yang bertakwa mendapat kemenangan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5704,
      "text": "(yaitu) kebun-kebun dan buah anggur,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5705,
      "text": "dan gadis-gadis belia yang sebaya,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5706,
      "text": "dan gelas-gelas yang penuh (berisi minuman).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5707,
      "text": "Di sana mereka tidak mendengar percakapan yang sia-sia maupun (perkataan) dusta.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5708,
      "text": "Sebagai balasan dan pemberian yang cukup banyak dari Tuhanmu,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5709,
      "text": "Tuhan (yang memelihara) langit dan bumi serta apa yang ada di antara keduanya; Yang Maha Pengasih, mereka tidak mampu berbicara dengan Dia.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5710,
      "text": "Pada hari, ketika rūḥ894) dan para malaikat berdiri bersaf-saf, mereka tidak berkata-kata, kecuali siapa yang telah diberi izin kepadanya oleh Tuhan Yang Maha Pengasih dan dia hanya mengatakan yang benar.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5711,
      "text": "Itulah hari yang pasti terjadi. Maka barangsiapa menghendaki, niscaya dia menempuh jalan kembali kepada Tuhannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5712,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya Kami telah memperingatkan kepadamu (orang kafir) azab yang dekat, pada hari manusia melihat apa yang telah diperbuat oleh kedua tangannya; dan orang kafir berkata, \"Alangkah baiknya seandainya dahulu aku jadi tanah.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 519,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5713,
      "text": "Demi (malaikat) yang mencabut (nyawa) dengan keras.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5714,
      "text": "Demi (malaikat) yang mencabut (nyawa) dengan lemah lembut.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5715,
      "text": "Demi (malaikat) yang turun dari langit dengan cepat,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5716,
      "text": "dan (malaikat) yang mendahului dengan kencang,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5717,
      "text": "dan (malaikat) yang mengatur urusan (dunia).895)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5718,
      "text": "(Sungguh, kamu akan dibangkitkan) pada hari ketika tiupan pertama mengguncangkan alam,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5719,
      "text": "(tiupan pertama) itu diiringi oleh tiupan kedua.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5720,
      "text": "Hati manusia pada waktu itu merasa sangat takut,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5721,
      "text": "pandangannya tunduk.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5722,
      "text": "(orang-orang kafir) berkata, \"Apakah kita benar-benar akan dikembalikan kepada kehidupan yang semula?896)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5723,
      "text": "Apakah (akan dibangkitkan juga) apabila kita telah menjadi tulang belulang yang hancur?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5724,
      "text": "Mereka berkata, \"Kalau demikian, itu adalah suatu pengembalian yang merugikan.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5725,
      "text": "Maka pengembalian itu hanyalah dengan sekali tiupan saja.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5726,
      "text": "Maka seketika itu mereka hidup kembali di bumi (yang baru).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
      "ruku": 520,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5727,
      "text": "Sudahkah sampai kepadamu (Muhammad) kisah Musa?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 79,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّازِعَاتِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naazi'aat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those who drag forth",
        "numberOfAyahs": 46,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 583,
